# What must not go into the build context of an image. The image of every unit under apps/ is built with the root
# of the repository as its context, so there is this one file.

# Secrets: a unit's .env is for this machine only. A deployed unit is given its configuration where it is deployed
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Dependencies installed on this machine (for another system, of no use in the image) and what builds leave behind
**/node_modules
**/dist

# What a unit keeps on the disk of the machine it runs on (for the api, the files people uploaded) and scratch
# files: the same two lines as in .gitignore
apps/*/data
apps/*/temp

.git
